  "description": "A long-standing prejudice and discrimination against Jewish people, which was institutionalized and radicalized by the Nazi regime. The Holocaust was the culmination of centuries of anti-Semitic hatred. The meme's condemnation of Hitler implicitly references his promotion of anti-Semitic ideology as the core driver of his genocidal policies, which is a key piece of background knowledge for understanding the historical context.",
